WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
12 sweets, 3 friends.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.130
How do you share fairly?

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.470
Give one each, round and round.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.050
Nobody gets more, nobody gets less.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.930
Everyone ends up with 4.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.016
12 ÷ 3 is 4.
